<title>FRANCE: Morgan Stanley cuts Technip rating to neutral.</title>
<headline>Morgan Stanley cuts Technip rating to neutral.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. investment firm Morgan Stanley has lowered its recommendation on the stock of French energy services firm Technip to neutral from buy, saying it considers the share correctly valued, market sources said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Shares in Technip were down 4.76 percent at 540 francs at 1415 GMT.</p>
<p>Morgan Stanley's objective for the stock is between 550 and 560 francs, the market sources said.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom, +33 1 4221 5452</p>
